mage": "engenn5le15ob07re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: We turned America's Walking City into our cycling city. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah, many attractions were built downtown. That's why the city is also called the Hub. I'm ready for a latte break.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Boston has so many interesting nicknames. It's really a City Upon a Hill. I was thinking about that on my bike when a new hill approached me.", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn5le15ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I like the City of Champions the best. Our baseball, basketball and football teams all won championships in the last 10 years.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah, you're such a sports fan. I didn't like sports when I was a child.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: In my childhood, when my parents worked on the yard, I was always watching sports games on TV.", "time": "22000"}, {"image": "engenn5le15ob07re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I don't think we're so much the Puritan City anymore. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: But we ARE still the Athens of America. As the city expanded, the locals were also developing their cultural interests.", "time": "43000"}], "coverimg": "engenn5le15ob07re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": "engenn5le15ob07re6aud01", "type": "audio"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "text", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}